  <section id="perencanaan">
    <h2>Perencanaan</h2>
    <article class="prompt-entry">
      <h3>Membuat rencana dari catatan diskusi</h3>
      <p>Sesi livestreaming Nuno Maduro yang bikin sosial media <a href="https://www.youtube.com/live/6zCNQa3hNm0?si=kwXlAHaorD5QLIhZ&t=4282" target="_blank">mulai menyusun rencana kasar</a> lalu LLM melengkapi menjadi rencana yang lebih menyeluruh.</p>
      <h4>Rencana kasar hasil diskusi, disimpan sebagai `TODO.md`</h4>
      <pre>
- Social Network / Social Media
-- Actions first (for API)
-- Social Media for Developers
-- Login: Socialite GitHub
--- GitHub (profile defaults, github stars)
--- Auto following socials (followers stuff)
-- posts (with uploads)
      </pre>
      <p>Lalu instruksikan LLM untuk melengkapi rencana tersebut dengan instruksi berikut.</p>
      <pre>Dear llm, take a look at TODO.md and ask a couple of questions. What should be included in this plan so that we can work towards something that we can implement and start from.
      </pre>
      <p>Hasilnya menjadi `TODO.md` yang lebih lengkap. <a href="https://github.com/nunomaduro/dev-null.sh/blob/38778fdcd0404d3e3dbff18d5b5e95179ae09913/TODO.md" target="_blank">Bisa dilihat langsung di reponya</a>.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="prompt-entry">
      <h3>Konfirmasi pemahaman dari ide kasar (<em>stream of consciousness</em>)</h3>
      <p class="prompt-meta">Lauren Tan (Poteto, SpaceX/Cursor) · Video livestream Grok Bot Galaxy Day 1</p>
      <p><strong>Tujuan:</strong> Memastikan LLM benar-benar menangkap maksud kita setelah menuangkan ide mentah secara panjang lebar (misalnya lewat <em>voice-to-text</em> atau <em>stream of consciousness</em>) sebelum lanjut ke tahap berikutnya.</p>
      <pre><code>Can you tell Grokpot that well, here comes the stream of consciousness, so bear with me Steve. But, so we're gonna build this pop-up platform where you can sort of host or use our software to spin up a pop-up, I guess, in your city or wherever you are. And we also want to dog food our own software meaning that we'll maybe figure out how to actually run our own pop-up. So, wait, do we actually need two landing pages? One for our own thing, and then one for the platform, right? One for professional restaurateurs, one for... Restaurateurs, yeah. I mean, franchise. We're gonna connect people. I don't know, we haven't figured out what food we're selling or what the pop-up will look like yet, but, likey our goal is, like, okay, well, we need to find people that can both sell food or create food or, like, you know, professionals. At some point, we're gonna need to find people who wanna come to our thing, but the start right now is gonna be, like, finding location, finding all these things. So, we probably wanna make it, like, look kind of reputable. Like, okay, like, here's what we're doing, we connect these sorts of people, this is the event that's happening, and then there's also, like, a landing page probably for, like, this pop-up. So... I feel like we're gonna need a lot of landing pages, cause we're, we're gonna, don't we need, like, like you mentioned, we'll need to find, like, restaurateurs, we need to find, so businesses who are, businesses or individuals who are interested in hosting A pop pop-up, but also people who we can hire, I guess. Okay. I'm gonna, I'm gonna send out this prompt. Hopefully you got all of that through.

---

restate to me what i just said in your own words so i know you understood me.</code></pre>
      <p><strong>Catatan:</strong> Bagian di atas garis pemisah (<code>---</code>) hanya contoh <em>stream of consciousness</em> dan bisa diganti dengan penjelasan atau ide mentah apa pun. Inti dari prompt ini ada pada kalimat terakhir: <code>restate to me what i just said in your own words so i know you understood me.</code> Cocok untuk <em>yapping</em> terutama jika pakai perintah suara sehingga perintah menjadi panjang.</p>
    </article>
